      "en": "Pipe P can fill a reservoir in 18 hours and Pipe Q can fill it in 24 hours. Pipe R can empty the full reservoir in 36 hours. All three pipes are opened together at 6:00 AM. After 6 hours, Pipe R is closed, and after another 2 hours, Pipe P is closed. At what time will the reservoir be completely filled?",
