    "correct": 3,
    "explanation": {
      "en": "Topic: Algebra | Subtopic: Cubic Factorization Identity | Difficulty: Moderate | Time: 40 sec\nEnglish Explanation:\nStep 1: Formula: p^(3)-q^(3)=(p-q)(p^(2)+pq+q^(2)).\n316=4(p^(2)+pq+q^(2))⟹p^(2)+pq+q^(2)=(316)/(4)=79\nStep 2: Square (p-q)=4:\n(p-q)^(2)=p^(2)-2pq+q^(2)=16\nStep 3: Subtract the two equations:\n(p^(2)+pq+q^(2))-(p^(2)-2pq+q^(2))=79-16⟹3pq=63⟹pq=21\nStep 4: Find p^(2)+q^(2):\np^(2)+q^(2)=(p-q)^(2)+2pq=16+2(21)=16+42=58\nExam Tip / పరీక్ష చిట్కా: Express p^(2)+q^(2) directly as (2(p^(3)-q^(3))+(p-q)^(3))/(3(p-q)).",
      "te": "తెలుగు వివరణ:\np^(3)-q^(3)=(p-q)(p^(2)+pq+q^(2))⟹316=4(p^(2)+pq+q^(2))⟹p^(2)+pq+q^(2)=79.\n(p-q)^(2)=p^(2)-2pq+q^(2)=16.\n3pq=79-16=63⟹pq=21.\np^(2)+q^(2)=16+2(21)=58 (ఎంపిక D)."
    },
