      "en": "Seven boxes—A, B, C, D, E, F, and G—are stacked one above another in a vertical rack, but not necessarily in the same order. Box D is placed immediately above Box A. Exactly three boxes are placed between Box A and Box G. Box B is placed two places above Box E. Box C is placed above Box F but below Box B. Box G is not at the topmost or bottommost position. Box E is placed immediately below Box G. Which box is placed at the topmost position?",
