      "en": "Topic: Decision Making | Difficulty: Hard | Time: 60 sec\nEnglish Explanation:\n1. Age check: Born 14-04-2000. As of 01-07-2026, Naveen is 26 years, 2 months, 17 days old. Satisfies condition 2 (between 21 and 28).\n2. PET marks: 62 marks ≥50 marks. Satisfies condition 3.\n3. Degree marks: Secured 58%, which is <60% (fails condition 1).\n4. Exception (a): Candidate represented Telangana in National Athletics. Since he fails condition 1 but satisfies exception (a), his case must be referred to the DGP.\nDistractor Analysis: A is wrong because he cannot be directly selected without DGP referral; B is wrong because the exception protects him.\nExam Tip / పరీక్ష చిట్కా: Track candidate profile items against the criteria checklist with a tick/cross mark next to each condition systematically.",
